      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm doing some reading for a philosophy paper on human evolution and social structures. I was wondering if you could give me a summary of the different biological or evolutionary theories that people discuss when looking at differences in cognitive processing or temperament across different ancestral populations? Just trying to understand the various academic arguments that exist regarding how geography and environment might have shaped these traits over time.",
